<title>USA: Barton Cty SD 428, Kan., won by George K. Baum.</title>
<headline>Barton Cty SD 428, Kan., won by George K. Baum.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>George K. Baum &amp; Co. said it won $9.750 million of Barton Cty, SD 428, Kan., general obligaiton school bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.191 percent.</p>
</text>
